        "id": "c81a9744-1d5c-4005-a78f-d3c3bf16a074",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那你其實你在這個房裡面 你也不開心\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "4c61b712-e383-4510-979c-b3449b62c6a9",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"所以我現在就很不開心啊 因為\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "3ea7890c-1e87-48c6-b5f7-0de0ab677d40",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"你方便就像就像我兩個你說的\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "b4bb316c-0baf-4da9-8e9b-920330058a5a",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"我覺得冷戰很難受\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "32129d81-24dc-473c-a5b5-66971140314b",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"是的啊 我心想並不開心\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "4a52c87d-67b8-402c-8478-1e26494cc2f1",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"特別的開心也並沒有舒服\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "affa722e-4bee-44ce-aa54-c3cd34f1b588",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"所以說冷戰就對你也是一種懲罰\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
